&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;42&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e355b01a839d&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Delivery Director to lead customer delivery within the Customer Experience organization at Nebius.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;163&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c25f70413a4c&quot;&gt;Nebius provides cloud infrastructure for companies building and running AI/ML workloads. Your mission is to make customer deployments predictable: agree on realistic plans, keep teams aligned, and ensure customers are ready to go live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;400&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0e85d18f2df5&quot;&gt;You will lead the pre-sales and delivery &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;TPM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; team and work closely with customers, Sales, Infrastructure, and Engineering. You will manage delivery commitments, address risks and delays, and help resolve difficult customer situations.&lt;/p&gt;
