&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;675&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1cd712909f49&quot;&gt;Coordinate customer delivery from contract signing to go-live, working with Infrastructure and Engineering on technical readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
