&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;902&quot; data-local-id=&quot;05f8437ef736&quot;&gt;Lead the pre-sales and delivery &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;TPM&lt;/span&gt; team: set priorities, assign ownership, hire and develop people.&lt;/p&gt;
